# gamifiedUI overview

Game-style 2D / 2.5D UI for Tailwind CSS v4: common components (button, panel, bar, dialog,
dialogue box) rendered as pixel-framed, raised game parts with stepped animation. CSS first and
framework-agnostic; framework wrappers are thin and optional.

## Layout (npm workspaces)

- `packages/gamifiedui-css/src/` - the product. `index.css` imports `tokens.css`, `themes.css`,
  `i18n.css`, `utilities.css` and `components/*.css`. Consumers write
  `@import "tailwindcss"; @import "gamifiedui-css";`. `scripts/build-cdn.mjs` prebuilds
  `dist/gamifiedui(-core)(.min).css` for `<link>` use; extend its `CANDIDATES` when adding a `@utility`.
- `packages/gamifiedui-icons/` - 16×16 ASCII-grid icons in `icons/*.mjs`; `scripts/build.mjs`
  generates `src/index.css` (`@utility`), `src/all.css`, `svg/` and `icons.json`. Never hand-edit outputs.
- `packages/gamifiedui-utils/src/` - optional, dependency-free TS helpers (toast, typewriter,
  counter, cooldown, effects, controls). The demo consumes them; components must still work without JS.
- `demo/` - Vite + `@tailwindcss/vite` playground, deployed to GitHub Pages. Every component and
  utility must appear here.
- `scripts/check-css.mjs` - compiles the package through Tailwind and enforces the motion and
  theming rules.

## Commands (PowerShell; no `&&` chaining in docs)

- `npm install`, `npm test` (CSS rules + stale-output checks), `npm run build:packages`
  (icons, CDN CSS, utils dist), `npm run build` (packages + demo), `npm run demo`.
- Every `dist/` is committed (jsDelivr GitHub CDN); rebuild and commit it with source changes.

## Planned packages

- `gamifiedui-sfx` - procedural UI sounds (no audio files), ported from spatial/StoryTelling.
- `gamifiedui-vue` / `gamifiedui-react` - thin wrappers; props only, no stores.

Related: 3D/XR runtime modules (three.js) live in a separate repo, never here.
